{"id":"dfc4da988d3b91c0","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-typed-subject-reduction.md","title":"βη 归约保持类型","display":"thm-typed-subject-reduction — βη 归约保持类型","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-typed-subject-reduction","aliases":["56-thm-typed-subject-reduction"],"display":"thm-typed-subject-reduction — βη 归约保持类型","depends_on":["[[56-thm-typed-substitution]]","[[56-df-beta-reduction]]"],"source_reference":"Local derivation from Terese (2003), Definitions 10.5.2,10.5.4,11.2.7, printed pp582,591","source_ocr_block":"603,612","verification_status":"local-typing-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-typed-subject-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-typed-subject-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-typed-subject-reduction — βη 归约保持类型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"724872afe5c644b4\" href=\"?note=724872afe5c644b4\" title=\"56-thm-typed-substitution\">56-thm-typed-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"650401013847f443\" href=\"?note=650401013847f443\" title=\"56-df-beta-reduction\">56-df-beta-reduction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Local derivation from Terese (2003), Definitions 10.5.2,10.5.4,11.2.7, printed pp582,591"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"603,612"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-typing-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 为同一变量、常元签名上的原始项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\Lambda(V,F,E_\\tau)\">\\(m,n\\in\\Lambda(V,F,E_\\tau)\\)</span>。类型语法与无捕获替换见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"724872afe5c644b4\" href=\"?note=724872afe5c644b4\" title=\"56-thm-typed-substitution\">56-thm-typed-substitution</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau\">\\(E_\\tau\\)</span> 只允许同类型变量改名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_\\beta\">\\(\\to_\\beta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_\\eta\">\\(\\to_\\eta\\)</span> 对原始项取原始关系，对商元素取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"650401013847f443\" href=\"?note=650401013847f443\" title=\"56-df-beta-reduction\">56-df-beta-reduction</a> 的代表元存在式所定义的商关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(M\\to_\\beta N\\lor M\\to_\\eta N)\\Longrightarrow N\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(M\\to_\\beta N\\lor M\\to_\\eta N)\\Longrightarrow N\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M\\equiv_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}N\\Longrightarrow N\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M\\equiv_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}N\\Longrightarrow N\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(m\\in\\Lambda_A\\land(m\\to_\\beta n\\lor m\\to_\\eta n)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow n\\in\\Lambda_A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(m\\in\\Lambda_A\\land(m\\to_\\beta n\\lor m\\to_\\eta n)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow n\\in\\Lambda_A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从原书 Definitions 10.5.2、10.5.4、11.2.7（印刷 pp582、591）给出的类型规则本地推导。β 根部由类型替换引理；η 根部在 x 不自由出现的条件下删除一个不使用的变量声明；相容闭包由类型推导的子结构反演。α 商版本随同类型改名不变性成立。此处只说类型保持，不说任意高阶对象规则都终止。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-thm-typed-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"724872afe5c644b4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-typed-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-beta-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"650401013847f443","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-beta-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-typed-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"724872afe5c644b4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}$、$M\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A$；$M,N$ 为同一变量、常元签名上的原始项，$m,n\\in\\Lambda(V,F,E_\\tau)$。类型语法与无捕获替换见 [[56-thm-typed-substitution]]，$E_\\tau$ 只允许同类型变量改名。$\\to_\\beta$、$\\to_\\eta$ 对原始项取原始关系，对商元素取 [[56-df-beta-reduction]] 的代表元存在式所定义的商关系。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-beta-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"650401013847f443","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}$、$M\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A$；$M,N$ 为同一变量、常元签名上的原始项，$m,n\\in\\Lambda(V,F,E_\\tau)$。类型语法与无捕获替换见 [[56-thm-typed-substitution]]，$E_\\tau$ 只允许同类型变量改名。$\\to_\\beta$、$\\to_\\eta$ 对原始项取原始关系，对商元素取 [[56-df-beta-reduction]] 的代表元存在式所定义的商关系。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Typ}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\Lambda(V,F,E_\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"E_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"(M\\to_\\beta N\\lor M\\to_\\eta N)\\Longrightarrow N\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A.","display":true},{"tex":"M\\equiv_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}N\\Longrightarrow N\\in\\mathrm{Pre}_A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl(m\\in\\Lambda_A\\land(m\\to_\\beta n\\lor m\\to_\\eta n)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow n\\in\\Lambda_A.","display":true}],"bytes":1612,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-299","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-typed-subject-reduction.md]]"},{"id":"24bd3576f4c5852a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d344b982e3ec8df3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["724872afe5c644b4","650401013847f443"]}